  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>Laminimas.com is a Germany-based online shop for curated pre-owned designer bags, vintage luxury items, jewelry and selected secondhand goods.</p><p>We are looking for affiliates, bloggers, creators, fashion pages, shopping websites, secondhand communities and luxury resale publishers who can promote authentic pre-owned designer bags to a fashion-conscious audience.</p><p>Our products include brands such as Louis Vuitton, Gucci, Prada, Dior, Chanel and other selected luxury labels. All items are presented with transparent condition descriptions, detailed product photos and secure shipping from Germany.</p><p>Affiliates can earn commission on every successful referral sale. This program is suitable for content about fashion, luxury, designer bags, secondhand shopping, vintage style, sustainable fashion, outfit inspiration and pre-owned luxury.</p><p>Promotion can be done through blogs, websites, social media, newsletters, Pinterest, Facebook groups, TikTok, Instagram or other suitable channels.</p><p><br></p><p>Commission is paid after the order is completed and the return period has passed.</p></div></div>",
